    "Places, corrections, descriptions, feelings: write anything. Return saves; your words are kept and AI organizes them. Option-Return starts a new line." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orte, Korrekturen, Beschreibungen, Gefühle: Schreib einfach los. Return sichert; deine Worte bleiben erhalten und die KI ordnet sie. Wahl-Return beginnt eine neue Zeile."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Places, corrections, descriptions, feelings: write anything. Return saves; your words are kept and AI organizes them. Option-Return starts a new line."
